# Reverse-engineering output. A Ghidra project holds the imported program's
# bytes, so a repo-local one would put the shipping game EXE into git history.
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.gzf
ghidra-projects/
*.exe

# Vendored loader payloads are the install-time source of truth
!vendor/**
# ...but the negation above re-admits everything under vendor/, including the
# *.exe rule that exists to keep a shipping game binary out of history. That
# guard is not waived anywhere, vendor included. No loader we vendor is an EXE.
vendor/**/*.exe
